            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.14.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bakyab 14:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Amazia yaasiba omwoyo, yaakulembera eigye lye, yaaja mu Kiiko ky'Omuunhu, yaitirayo abaisirukale Abaedomu omutwalo mulamba (10,000). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abayudaaya baagema n'abantu abandi omutwalo mulala, baabatwala ghaigulu ku ngulu ku lubaale, memale baabawoloba ghansi, boonaboona baamanhianguka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyo nga bikaali agho, abaisirukale Abaisiraeli Amazia be yaizaayo ng'abalobeire okuja naye mu lutalo, baaja baalumba ebibuga bya Buyudaaya, okuva e Samaria okutuuka e Bethi Horoni, baitamu abantu enkumi isatu (3,000) era baatwala n'omunhago mungi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amazia bweyali ng'amaze okwita Abaedomu, yaaleeta emisambwa gy'abantu abo ab'e Seiri. Yaagitaagho gibenga bakatonda be, era yaagisinza n'okuginiokeza obubbaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda kyeyava n'asungughalira Amazia, yaamusindikira omulanzi. Omulanzi oyo yaamukoba ati: “Lwaki oli kusinza emisambwa egy'abantu egyalemwa okuwonia abantu baagyo okubatoola mu buyinza bwo?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye yali akaayogera, kyabazinga yaamukoba ati: “Twakulonda li okuba omuwi ow'amagezi wa kyabazinga? Sirika, okutoolaku ng'oli kunoonia kukwita!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omulanzi yaasirika, aye era ng'amaze okumukoba ati: “Ndidhi nga Katonda mumalirivu okukuzikiriza, kuba okoze ekyo era waaloba kuwulirisa magezi ge nkughaire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho kyabazinga Amazia owa Buyudaaya ng'amaze okwebuuzaaku ku bamugha amagezi, yaatuma abakwenda eri kyabazinga Yoashi owa Isiraeli, mutabane wa Yehoahazi era mwidhukulu wa Yehu, ng'akoba ati: “Ale idha twagaanane, tulinzaganie obweni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ate kyabazinga Yehoashi owa Isiraeli yaagheereza kyabazinga Amazia owa Buyudaaya obukwenda ng'akoba ati: “Olukandwa olwali ku lusozi Lebanoni lwagheereza obukwenda eri omuvule ogwali ku lusozi olwo Lebanoni, nga lukoba luti, ‘Gha mutabane wange mughala wo amubayize.’ Agho ensolo ey'omu nsiko ey'oku lusozi Lebanoni bweyali ebita, yaatyankirira olukandwa olwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpegaano oli kukoba oti, ‘Bona eno, naghangula Edomu!’ Ekyo kyakuleetera okwekuluntaza. Kale ni ba ewuwo weesaake n'ekyo. Lwaki onaawuula ebizibu eby'okukuzikiriza iwe ni Buyudaaya yoonayoona?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Amazia yaaloba okuwulirisa, kuba Katonda yayenda okubaghaayo baghangulwe abazigu baibwe, olw'okusinza emisambwa egya Abaedomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale Yehoashi kyabazinga wa Isiraeli kyeyava ni yeesowolayo okulumba Amazia kyabazinga wa Buyudaaya, baalinzagania obweni mu lutalo olwali e Bathi Shemeshi ekya Buyudaaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isiraeli yaaghangula Buyudaaya, kiisi mwisirukale wa Buyudaaya yaalumuka okwiragho ewuwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho kyabazinga Yehoashi owa Isiraeli, yaagema kyabazinga Amazia owa Buyudaaya mutabane wa Yoashi era mwidhukulu wa Ahazia, ng'amugemera e Bethi Shemeshi. Yaamuleeta e Yerusalemu, era Yehoashi oyo yaamenha ekimante ekyezungulwire ekibuga Yerusalemu ekyo, okuva ku Mulyango gwa Efuraimu okutuuka ku Mulyango Ogwokunsonda obwo nga n'obuleeyi bwa mita ng'oti ebikumi bibiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaanhaga zaabu ni feeza yeenayeena, n'ebintu ebikozesebwa byonabyona bye yayagaana mu isinzizo lya Musengwa Katonda, ebyakuumibwanga Obedi Edomu. Yaatwala n'eby'obukombe eby'omu kisaagaati kya kyabazinga, era yaatwala n'abantu ng'omusingo. Agho yairayo e Samaria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
